message: >-
  If you use this software in your research, or build upon it in your own work,
  please cite it using the metadata below.
title: NH Reader
abstract: >-
  NH Reader is a lightweight, modern, cross-platform desktop and Android client
  for nhentai.net, built with Tauri 2 and SvelteKit. It provides a custom UI,
  advanced search and filtering, a global blacklist, favorites and history,
  a paged gallery reader, background download and prefetch services, a disk
  image cache, and a native unified installer.
type: software
